 "type": "hazard",
 "summary": "build_search_index.py fails \"unexpected token in shard-NNN.json\" on stale cache; fix with --clear-cache",
 "content": "Running `python scripts/build_search_index.py` can fail with \"index build failed: unexpected token in shard-000.json\". The message is misleading: the cause is that cached token shards in var/cache/search/ were written by an older tokenizer version (shard has \"tokenizer\": 2, script expects TOKENIZER = 3). Fix: rerun with `python scripts/build_search_index.py --clear-cache`, which deletes the git-ignored cache and rebuilds into var/search/. Expect this after any bump of TOKENIZER in the script.",
 "physical": [
  "scripts/build_search_index.py"
 ],
